@startuml seq-export
title Spreadsheet export

actor Lecturer
participant "Lecturer page" as UI
participant "HTTP API" as API
participant ExportService as Exp

Lecturer -> UI : Download CSV or XLSX
UI -> API : GET /export.csv or /export.xlsx\nX-Lecturer-Token
API -> Exp : rows from attendance records
Exp --> UI : file bytes
note right of Exp
  Columns: student id, name, mode,
  seat zone, time, confidence,
  flags, subnet, device id.
  The file is for the lecturer.
  It is not sent to the model.
end note
@enduml
